            "canva", false,
            "Активируйте в следующих случаях: the user asks \"is this on brand\", \"check this against our brand kit\", \"do a brand review\", \"does this match our brand guidelines\", or \"brand-check my design\".",
            "@canva-brand-check Активируй скилл canva-brand-check для выполнения комплексного анализа и реализации задачи.",
            ["**If the kit exposes colors/fonts** use those exact hex codes and font names as the rubric (precise check).", "`Canva:list-brand-kits`. If several, ask which one (or infer from team/context).", "Capture whatever the kit exposes (name, thumbnail, and colors/fonts if present).", "`Canva:get-design-thumbnail` for visual/logo/tone."],
