            ["`name` identifies one stable measurement, such as `orders.created` or `orders.duration_ms`.", "`tags` are optional string attributes. After ingestion, discovered tag keys appear as dimensions for filtering and grouping.", "`metric()` is synchronous and returns `void`; do not `await` it.", "Prefer stable, dotted names with a unit suffix where useful: `checkout.completed`, `checkout.duration_ms`, `queue.batch_size`."],
