            "@daemons Настрой облачную архитектуру с помощью daemons: оптимизируй серверные функции, кэширование, маршрутизацию и параметры окружения.",
            ["**Rejected fields**: service fields such as `framework`, `runtime`, `buildCommand`, and `bindings` fail validation on a daemon.", "**Build**: images are built for Linux `amd64`. Deployment environment variables are passed to the image build as build arguments.", "**Shell features**: `command` is exec-form. Use `[\"sh\", \"-c\", \"exec node worker.js --id $WORKER_ID\"]` for variable expansion.", "**No `CMD`**: the build fails if the image has neither `ENTRYPOINT` nor `CMD` and `command` is not set."],
