            "@dart-fix-runtime-errors Активируй скилл dart-fix-runtime-errors для выполнения комплексного анализа и реализации задачи.",
            ["Core Concepts & Guidelines", "**Modifiers:** Apply `?` for nullable types, `!` for null assertions, and `required` for named parameters that cannot be null.", "**Catching:** Catch `Exception` subtypes for recoverable failures.", "**Rethrowing:** Use `rethrow` inside a `catch` block to propagate an exception while preserving its original stack trace."],
