            "Custom design system for a macOS SwiftUI app with its own parts, not Apple's, covering three token layers, type, an icon set, every part in every state, custom window chrome, a parts gallery, and checks. Use when the user wants the app to have its own look and feel, a brand, or custom buttons, rows, and sidebars, when design-from-app has measured a reference app, or when the user asks for a design system or component library.",
            "Custom design system for a macOS SwiftUI app with its own parts, not Apple's, covering three token layers, type, an icon set, every part in every state, custom window chrome, a parts gallery, and checks. Use when the user wants the app to have its own look and feel, a brand, or custom buttons, rows, and sidebars, when design-from-app has measured a reference app, or when the user asks for a design system or component library. Специализированный инструмент платформы Antigravity для расширения возможностей автономных агентов и инженеров.\n\nВ процессе работы навык проводит глубокий анализ контекста: A native look comes from Apple's parts. A custom look comes from your own\nparts: your sidebar row, your button, your checkbox, your icons. SwiftUI\ndraws all of them. A kit is those parts, the numbers behind them, and one\npage that shows every part in every state.\n\nВыходные результаты включают готовый код, обновленную спецификацию, проверенные тесты и структурированные рекомендации. Гарантируется соблюдение принципов надежности, чистота зависимостей, отсутствие регрессий и нулевое использование визуального шума (Zero Slop).",
