        new("design-system", "Дизайн и эстетика (Anti-Slop)",
            "Accent color and design system for a macOS app, from the app's accent and the accent picker in Settings to Swift tokens in code plus a design/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md that says which token to use when. Use when the user wants a brand or accent color, wants people to pick a color, when an app has more than a few screens, when screens drift apart or animations feel inconsistent, or when the user asks for themes, a style guide, or design tokens.",
            "Accent color and design system for a macOS app, from the app's accent and the accent picker in Settings to Swift tokens in code plus a design/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md that says which token to use when. Use when the user wants a brand or accent color, wants people to pick a color, when an app has more than a few screens, when screens drift apart or animations feel inconsistent, or when the user asks for themes, a style guide, or design tokens. Специализированный инструмент платформы Antigravity для расширения возможностей автономных агентов и инженеров.\n\nВ процессе работы навык проводит глубокий анализ контекста: A design system is a short list of **tokens** in code and one page that\nsays which token to use when. Every screen uses tokens, never raw values.\nThen a change in one place changes the whole app, and an agent can review a\nscreen against one page.\n\nВыходные результаты включают готовый код, обновленную спецификацию, проверенные тесты и структурированные рекомендации. Гарантируется соблюдение принципов надежности, чистота зависимостей, отсутствие регрессий и нулевое использование визуального шума (Zero Slop).",
