            ["The input is an existing raw or static HTML document. Pass it directly to `html_to_figma`.", "If the user wants to write **Code Connect mappings**, switch to figma-code-connect.", "Figma MCP server must be connected", "The target Figma file must have a published design system with components (or access to a team library)"],
