            "@figma-generate-library Активируй скилл figma-generate-library для выполнения комплексного анализа и реализации задачи.",
            ["Required variable scopes, aliases, code syntax, component properties, variants, and bindings are verified.", "Use `return` to send data back (auto-serialized). Do NOT wrap in IIFE or call closePlugin.", "Return ALL created/mutated node IDs in every return value", "`figma.notify()` throws — never use it"],
