            ">- Audits Firebase (Firestore, Cloud Storage) security rules for vulnerabilities, privilege escalation, role bypasses, create vs update inconsistencies, resource exhaustion, type safety, size limits, and hasOnly ownership checks. Use when auditing/reviewing rules, running red-team rule assessments, or scoring against auditor checklists. Don't use for Firebase CLI (login, deploy), Auth, Crashlytics, Remote Config, or database queries.",
            ">- Audits Firebase (Firestore, Cloud Storage) security rules for vulnerabilities, privilege escalation, role bypasses, create vs update inconsistencies, resource exhaustion, type safety, size limits, and hasOnly ownership checks. Use when auditing/reviewing rules, running red-team rule assessments, or scoring against auditor checklists. Don't use for Firebase CLI (login, deploy), Auth, Crashlytics, Remote Config, or database queries. Специализированный инструмент платформы Antigravity для расширения возможностей автономных агентов и инженеров.\n\nВ процессе работы навык проводит глубокий анализ контекста: This skill acts as an auditor for Firebase Security Rules, evaluating them\nagainst a rigorous set of criteria to ensure they are secure, robust, and\ncorrectly implemented.\n\nВыходные результаты включают готовый код, обновленную спецификацию, проверенные тесты и структурированные рекомендации. Гарантируется соблюдение принципов надежности, чистота зависимостей, отсутствие регрессий и нулевое использование визуального шума (Zero Slop).",
