        new("os-integrations", "Система и ядро Antigravity",
            "Deep macOS integrations for a native app, such as global hotkeys, menu bar items, floating panels, window control with Accessibility, screen capture and recording, clipboard, Shortcuts and Spotlight, URL schemes, login items, a CLI, and the permissions each one needs. Use when an app must reach outside its own window or control other apps.",
