            "Redesign any screen from patterns real apps ship. Share a screenshot, your code or a design file, and the skill finds how apps on Mobbin handle the same screen. Explore a few directions or fix specific problems, and see the evidence behind each change. You get a before and after image and a short report. The redesign stays in your own design system, and anything that already works is kept. Use whenever the user points at a screen, section, or component they have, or at a reference, a Mobbin result, one or more Mobbin collections or the screens they saved, and asks to redesign, improve, restyle, or rebuild it, or to see a few directions for it. Специализированный инструмент платформы Antigravity для расширения возможностей автономных агентов и инженеров.\n\nВ процессе работы навык проводит глубокий анализ контекста: Work as a design lead whose every decision is backed by a real product. Someone has a screen that exists and wants a better version of it. The references decide what to build and are the evidence for it. The user's own design decides how it looks. Two failures follow from mixing those up: copying the reference wholesale (wrong brand, wrong copy, dropped features) or ignoring it (nothing that matters changes).\n\nВыходные результаты включают готовый код, обновленную спецификацию, проверенные тесты и структурированные рекомендации. Гарантируется соблюдение принципов надежности, чистота зависимостей, отсутствие регрессий и нулевое использование визуального шума (Zero Slop).",
