            ["Дисциплинированная разработка", "Apple HIG / Vercel стандарты", "Zero AI slop"],
            ["stitch::code-to-design", "stitch-design"]),
        new("stitch::extract-design-md", "Инструменты Stitch AI",
            ">- Extract a comprehensive design system (DESIGN.md) directly from frontend source code — React, Vue, Svelte, Angular, plain HTML/CSS, or any web framework. Analyzes component files, stylesheets, Tailwind configs, theme definitions, and design tokens to produce a rich, Stitch-compatible design system document. Use this skill whenever the user wants to reverse-engineer a design system from an existing codebase, audit the visual language of a project, extract design tokens from source files, or understand the styling patterns in a frontend repo — even if they just say \"what does this app look like?\" or \"pull out the design from this code.",
            ">- Extract a comprehensive design system (DESIGN.md) directly from frontend source code — React, Vue, Svelte, Angular, plain HTML/CSS, or any web framework. Analyzes component files, stylesheets, Tailwind configs, theme definitions, and design tokens to produce a rich, Stitch-compatible design system document. Use this skill whenever the user wants to reverse-engineer a design system from an existing codebase, audit the visual language of a project, extract design tokens from source files, or understand the styling patterns in a frontend repo — even if they just say \"what does this app look like?\" or \"pull out the design from this code. Специализированный инструмент платформы Antigravity для расширения возможностей автономных агентов и инженеров.\n\nВ процессе работы навык проводит глубокий анализ контекста: Analyze frontend source code to extract a comprehensive design system document\n(DESIGN.md) that captures the project's visual language — colors, typography,\nspacing, component patterns, and layout principles — directly from the source\nfiles, without needing to build or render the application.\n\nВыходные результаты включают готовый код, обновленную спецификацию, проверенные тесты и структурированные рекомендации. Гарантируется соблюдение принципов надежности, чистота зависимостей, отсутствие регрессий и нулевое использование визуального шума (Zero Slop).",
